WEBVTT

00:00.834 --> 00:02.711
The Twelve Demon Moons

00:02.794 --> 00:04.796
should have larger concentration
of Kibutsuji's blood.

00:05.672 --> 00:07.048
If I could get their blood,

00:07.132 --> 00:10.301
it'll speed up the completion of the drug
to turn Nezuko back into human.

00:12.595 --> 00:14.180
Right. Inosuke!

00:18.518 --> 00:20.395
Did you defeat her?

00:20.979 --> 00:23.356
Are you okay, Inosuke?

00:23.440 --> 00:25.734
I'm asking if you defeated her or not.

00:25.817 --> 00:27.110
Yes, I did.

00:27.193 --> 00:29.446
That's not important. Are you injured?

00:29.529 --> 00:33.116
I don't need your concern!

00:33.199 --> 00:35.201
Listen carefully.
Make sure you understand this.

00:35.285 --> 00:38.872
Whatever you can achieve, I can do it too.

00:38.955 --> 00:44.085
Soon, my head will be sturdier than yours.

00:44.169 --> 00:48.006
And then…

00:49.048 --> 00:50.884
He's seriously injured.

00:50.967 --> 00:53.553
I didn't manage to save my other comrades.

00:54.971 --> 00:58.349
That demon smells of fear and suffering.

01:00.894 --> 01:03.521
Enough to make her desperate for death.

01:08.568 --> 01:10.987
What's happening on this mountain?

01:11.946 --> 01:13.740
-The twelve demons are here.
-Inosuke, don't move.

01:13.823 --> 01:15.950
-A family of demons is perched here.
-Stop! I don't need it.

01:16.034 --> 01:17.744
I'm fine!

01:17.827 --> 01:21.164
But I thought demons don't work in groups.

01:24.417 --> 01:25.418
That hurts!

01:28.797 --> 01:30.423
It hurts.

01:30.924 --> 01:33.092
It seems I was stung by something.

01:33.176 --> 01:34.803
What the heck?

01:34.886 --> 01:36.679
I'm pissed.

01:36.763 --> 01:39.349
I can't find Tanjiro and the rest.
This is the worst!

01:39.432 --> 01:40.934
Where the heck did they go?

01:41.601 --> 01:43.019
Which way should I go?

01:43.102 --> 01:45.021
Plus, this place stinks.

01:45.104 --> 01:46.022
It stinks!

01:46.648 --> 01:48.274
I want to cry.

01:49.067 --> 01:52.529
The scurrying sounds made
by these spiders creeps me out!

01:52.612 --> 01:55.990
These spiders are trying
their best to survive too though!

01:58.076 --> 01:59.494
Damn you. How noisy!

01:59.577 --> 02:00.662
Keep quiet!

02:03.790 --> 02:06.543
Is this even possible?

03:46.976 --> 03:49.729
That was a human face!
It's a human-faced spider!

03:49.812 --> 03:52.440
What's going on?
What the heck is going on?

03:52.523 --> 03:54.067
This is a dream!

03:54.150 --> 03:56.152
Please tell me this is a dream!

03:56.236 --> 03:59.197
If this is a dream, I'll try my best.

03:59.280 --> 04:01.783
After I wake up,
if I could lie on Nezuko's lap,

04:01.866 --> 04:03.618
I'll definitely go all out!

04:03.701 --> 04:05.411
I'll work hard on the field!

04:05.495 --> 04:08.539
Be it 10,674 or 21,348 square feet,
I'll definitely work hard to cultivate it!

04:08.623 --> 04:09.874
So…

04:10.541 --> 04:15.713
Please let me wake up from this nightmare!

04:28.476 --> 04:31.187
What's that?

04:31.271 --> 04:34.399
Are these people turning into spiders?

04:35.775 --> 04:37.610
Is the house floating?

04:37.694 --> 04:39.529
It seems I could vaguely see…

04:39.612 --> 04:40.863
Are those threads?

04:40.947 --> 04:42.615
Plus, the stench is unbearable.

04:42.699 --> 04:44.534
What a pungent stench.

04:44.617 --> 04:47.578
If the master of smell, Tanjiro,
was here, he would've died!

04:47.662 --> 04:49.872
The stench is so unpleasant
that my throat hurts.

04:49.956 --> 04:51.582
My tears are falling.

04:51.666 --> 04:52.959
My eyes hurt so much.

05:05.888 --> 05:07.056
It's huge!

05:07.807 --> 05:09.892
What a huge spider!

05:10.435 --> 05:11.686
It's massive!

05:11.769 --> 05:13.396
This is unbelievable!

05:19.527 --> 05:23.323
There's no way am I talking
to someone like you!

05:28.953 --> 05:30.913
Running away is pointless.

05:30.997 --> 05:32.832
You already lost.

05:32.915 --> 05:34.709
What nonsense are you spewing?

05:34.792 --> 05:36.711
Listen carefully! Don't talk to me!

05:36.794 --> 05:39.589
I hate your kind the most!

05:39.672 --> 05:41.424
You already know, don't you?

05:41.507 --> 05:43.426
Something bad is going to happen.

05:43.509 --> 05:44.802
What do you mean?

05:44.886 --> 05:46.262
Look at your own hand.

05:46.345 --> 05:47.597
What? My hand?

05:49.766 --> 05:50.808
What's with my hand?

05:53.728 --> 05:54.771
This is…

05:55.480 --> 05:56.856
You're poisoned.

05:56.939 --> 05:59.358
You were bitten by a spider, weren't you?

05:59.442 --> 06:01.903
The poison will turn you into a spider.

06:05.490 --> 06:09.619
In 30 minutes, you'll become my slave
and crawl on the ground.

06:12.538 --> 06:14.582
Look. This is a clock.

06:14.665 --> 06:16.292
Do you know how it works?

06:16.375 --> 06:19.337
After the long hand
moves around in one circle,

06:19.420 --> 06:21.798
you'll become the spider's companion.

06:22.507 --> 06:26.302
When the hand reaches here,
your limbs will feel numb and painful.

06:27.345 --> 06:30.556
When it reaches here,
you'll feel dizzy and nauseous.

06:31.390 --> 06:33.768
When it's here,
you'll be in excruciating pain.

06:33.851 --> 06:36.187
Your body will shrink
and you'll lose consciousness.

06:36.896 --> 06:39.023
After that, when you wake up…

06:50.034 --> 06:52.995
10:55 P.M.

06:55.706 --> 06:56.666
10:56 P.M.

07:07.635 --> 07:10.346
-Even if you run--
-It's useless, right? Yes!

07:10.430 --> 07:13.891
I know! I know that!

07:17.270 --> 07:18.771
What are you doing?

07:18.855 --> 07:21.482
Shut up!

07:21.566 --> 07:23.651
Don't be afraid.

07:23.734 --> 07:25.903
When the toxins spread
until you turn into a spider,

07:25.987 --> 07:27.530
you'll lose your intelligence too.

07:27.613 --> 07:30.825
No! That's what I hate!

07:30.908 --> 07:32.869
Why don't you understand?

07:32.952 --> 07:34.537
You don't have friends or lovers, do you?

07:34.620 --> 07:35.913
No wonder you're hated!

07:36.789 --> 07:38.458
You want me to poison you again

07:38.541 --> 07:40.668
so that you can turn into
a spider faster, don't you?

07:45.715 --> 07:47.216
I don't want that!

07:47.300 --> 07:49.177
I don't want to become that!

07:51.387 --> 07:52.930
Get it together!

07:53.014 --> 07:55.099
Don't cry! Don't run away!

07:55.183 --> 07:57.685
Your actions are meaningless.

07:57.768 --> 07:58.978
Zenitsu!

07:59.896 --> 08:01.272
Get down.

08:01.355 --> 08:03.024
Continue with your training.

08:03.107 --> 08:05.067
No, I thought I was going to die!

08:05.151 --> 08:08.571
If I continue training,
I think I'll really die!

08:09.197 --> 08:11.991
This kind of training won't kill you.

08:12.074 --> 08:14.118
Get down now, you idiot!

08:14.202 --> 08:15.453
Grandpa!

08:15.536 --> 08:17.371
Call me master!

08:17.455 --> 08:19.957
I really like you, Grandpa.

08:23.169 --> 08:27.173
The girl I liked cheated my money
so that she could elope with another man.

08:27.256 --> 08:30.468
It was you who saved me
from a lifetime of debt!

08:30.551 --> 08:33.721
But maybe it was because
you wanted to train a swordsman.

08:33.804 --> 08:36.891
Actually, I wanted to meet
your expectations too!

08:36.974 --> 08:38.935
But I couldn't do it!

08:39.018 --> 08:42.605
I feel like I have failed you!

08:42.688 --> 08:44.941
I have been practicing behind your back!

08:45.024 --> 08:47.068
I didn't sleep at all!

08:47.151 --> 08:49.529
But I achieved nothing in the end!

08:49.612 --> 08:50.655
What's going on?

08:50.738 --> 08:53.157
Tell me. What's going on?

08:53.241 --> 08:55.117
Calm down, Zenitsu!

08:55.201 --> 08:57.286
You have talent.

08:57.370 --> 08:59.080
I'm already…

09:02.583 --> 09:05.253
Zenitsu!

09:06.504 --> 09:08.172
I had enough of my life.

09:08.756 --> 09:10.508
I was even struck by lightning.

09:12.260 --> 09:14.637
My hair color changed.

09:16.806 --> 09:19.850
I'm grateful to be alive though.

09:22.228 --> 09:26.232
I'm the one who dislikes myself the most.

09:28.359 --> 09:31.279
I've always known I should try my best.

09:31.362 --> 09:32.697
But I'm scared.

09:32.780 --> 09:35.408
I'll run away and cry.

09:37.159 --> 09:38.661
I want to change.

09:38.744 --> 09:40.705
I want to be useful.

09:42.206 --> 09:43.666
But…

09:43.749 --> 09:46.085
Actually, I already tried my hardest!

09:46.168 --> 09:49.463
But in the end, am I going to lose
all my hair and become a monster?

09:49.547 --> 09:52.008
You've got to be kidding me!
This is so unreasonable!

09:54.885 --> 09:56.721
What the heck is wrong with this guy?

10:00.641 --> 10:02.727
No! Don't come up here!

10:02.810 --> 10:05.021
Could you leave me alone?

10:05.104 --> 10:08.357
Just for a short while!

10:14.822 --> 10:16.949
Am I going to lose my hair at this stage?

10:18.326 --> 10:19.994
My hair are falling off.

10:20.077 --> 10:22.705
That guy said nothing about this just now!

10:33.257 --> 10:35.301
What the heck is wrong with this guy?

10:35.384 --> 10:39.180
Isn't he one of the demon slayers
who came here to kill us?

10:39.889 --> 10:41.390
Did he faint?

10:41.474 --> 10:43.351
What a coward.

10:45.561 --> 10:47.730
He's dead if he falls headfirst.

10:48.314 --> 10:49.523
What the heck?

10:57.448 --> 11:00.034
Breath of Thunder. First Form.

11:08.834 --> 11:09.919
Poison Sputum!

11:17.968 --> 11:20.763
He actually spun his body
and dodged my attack mid-air.

11:20.846 --> 11:23.974
Compared to the guy just now,
he's different and more agile.

11:26.435 --> 11:29.480
Breath of Thunder. First Form.

11:29.563 --> 11:31.774
Everyone, attack him!

11:35.486 --> 11:38.197
Breath of Thunder. First Form.

11:43.244 --> 11:46.622
He has been keeping
that same stance since earlier.

11:48.749 --> 11:49.959
I get it.

11:50.042 --> 11:51.335
This guy

11:52.586 --> 11:55.297
only knows one move.

11:57.383 --> 11:59.427
Listen carefully, Zenitsu.

11:59.510 --> 12:01.178
This is great.

12:02.138 --> 12:04.598
Learning one move
is enough for you to celebrate.

12:06.434 --> 12:10.396
Since you could only learn one move,
then you must hone it to perfection.

12:13.899 --> 12:16.861
Practice it to an extent
that's beyond perfection.

12:18.946 --> 12:21.115
That's not right, Grandpa.

12:21.198 --> 12:23.325
Weren't you furious not long ago?

12:23.951 --> 12:26.370
Because Breath of Thunder has six forms.

12:26.454 --> 12:28.539
But I could only learn the first form.

12:30.624 --> 12:33.169
Do you know how a katana is forged?

12:36.464 --> 12:37.631
How would I know?

12:37.715 --> 12:38.883
Will you keep on hitting me?

12:38.966 --> 12:40.009
I'll definitely cry.

12:42.219 --> 12:46.098
After the knife is hammered
and refined multiple times,

12:46.182 --> 12:48.434
the impurities and excess components
are removed

12:48.517 --> 12:50.436
to improve the purity of the steel

12:50.519 --> 12:52.938
in order to create a strong katana.

12:54.148 --> 12:57.234
Is that why Grandpa hit me every day?

12:59.320 --> 13:01.530
But I'm not steel.

13:02.323 --> 13:03.866
I'm human.

13:06.035 --> 13:08.412
There's nothing special about this guy.

13:08.496 --> 13:10.748
How could he be a demon slayer
with this standard?

13:10.831 --> 13:14.043
You can't move
because of the toxins, can you?

13:15.878 --> 13:18.088
Zenitsu, hone it to beyond perfection.

13:18.714 --> 13:20.090
Cry if you want.

13:20.174 --> 13:21.759
Run away if you must.

13:22.635 --> 13:24.512
But never give up.

13:25.804 --> 13:27.389
You must believe.

13:28.098 --> 13:31.477
Believe in those days
of training that feels like hell.

13:31.560 --> 13:33.896
Your efforts will definitely be rewarded.

13:34.438 --> 13:36.482
Hone it to perfection.

13:36.565 --> 13:39.485
Become a stronger sword
than everyone else.

13:40.861 --> 13:43.072
You must master a single thing.

13:50.704 --> 13:51.830
Go away.

13:57.336 --> 13:59.255
Don't make me repeat myself.

13:59.338 --> 14:00.506
Go away.

14:01.840 --> 14:03.175
You heard me, didn't you?

14:04.134 --> 14:08.389
Crying from morning to night,
aren't you embarrassed?

14:11.559 --> 14:12.810
What a foolish guy.

14:12.893 --> 14:16.105
Spending time on a guy like you
is a complete waste of time.

14:17.189 --> 14:20.067
Our master is an amazing person.

14:20.150 --> 14:21.443
But Grandpa--

14:23.028 --> 14:26.282
He's not your grandpa.
Don't call him that!

14:26.907 --> 14:28.868
Our master was once a Hashira.

14:28.951 --> 14:31.954
It's a title for the strongest people
in Demon Slayer Corps!

14:33.581 --> 14:37.126
Receiving the guidance of a former Hashira
is an extremely rare case.

14:37.751 --> 14:40.504
The time our master spend
on you for your training

14:40.588 --> 14:42.214
is a complete waste!

14:42.298 --> 14:44.383
You're an eyesore to me!
Get out of my sight!

14:45.009 --> 14:46.886
Why are you here?

14:46.969 --> 14:49.138
Why don't you leave already?

14:59.982 --> 15:03.277
As an orphan,
nobody expect anything out of me.

15:04.695 --> 15:07.656
Nobody puts hope on me
for what I could master

15:07.740 --> 15:10.659
or for what I could achieve.

15:12.786 --> 15:14.663
Being able to help someone

15:14.747 --> 15:16.749
even if it's only one person
in this lifetime…

15:16.832 --> 15:21.253
A simple future of protecting her
and making her happy…

15:22.463 --> 15:24.423
Nobody expects me to achieve that at all.

15:25.424 --> 15:28.177
Whenever I fail for the first time,
I'll cry and run away.

15:29.553 --> 15:32.139
Everyone will think I'm hopeless
and stay away from me after that.

15:34.475 --> 15:35.893
But Grandpa was different.

15:40.147 --> 15:43.317
No matter how many times it happened,
he would always rebuke me.

15:45.819 --> 15:47.905
Time and time again, I would ran away.

15:49.823 --> 15:51.283
Time and time again,

15:52.701 --> 15:53.953
he would drag me back.

15:57.539 --> 16:00.042
Although he really beat me
too hard sometimes,

16:01.752 --> 16:03.879
he was never disappointed in me.

16:05.631 --> 16:06.548
Sting him!

16:06.632 --> 16:08.592
Inject more toxins into him!

16:21.689 --> 16:23.357
At this rate, this guy will…

16:29.279 --> 16:30.322
What's going on?

16:30.906 --> 16:32.449
The air is vibrating.

16:35.285 --> 16:37.705
Breath of Thunder. First Form.

16:38.831 --> 16:40.207
Thunderclap and Flash.

16:43.293 --> 16:44.169
Six Fold.

16:50.467 --> 16:51.385
He vanished!

17:12.364 --> 17:13.824
Did I get hit?

17:13.907 --> 17:16.285
I got hit.

17:17.161 --> 17:18.454
That guy did it.

17:19.538 --> 17:20.956
Someone like him.

17:27.921 --> 17:29.757
How could this happen?

17:29.840 --> 17:34.136
A guy who couldn't move
because of the poison actually…

17:34.803 --> 17:38.724
11:19 P.M.

17:43.062 --> 17:44.646
I had a dream.

17:46.315 --> 17:48.525
It was a nice dream.

17:48.609 --> 17:50.360
I was very strong in the dream.

17:50.444 --> 17:51.987
Stronger than everyone else.

17:52.613 --> 17:56.283
I have the ability to help the weak
and the people in trouble.

17:56.992 --> 17:58.202
I was always helping.

17:59.369 --> 18:01.622
The things Grandpa taught me,

18:02.164 --> 18:04.124
the time he spent on me,

18:04.208 --> 18:05.417
weren't a complete waste.

18:07.002 --> 18:09.963
It's all thanks to Grandpa
that I became strong

18:10.047 --> 18:13.967
and helped many people in that dream.

18:16.220 --> 18:19.056
But I don't think I can make it.

18:24.978 --> 18:27.231
Chuntaro.

18:28.899 --> 18:30.109
I'm sorry.

18:42.329 --> 18:43.956
Don't give up!

18:54.007 --> 18:55.384
I can't give up.

18:56.176 --> 18:59.888
I must use my breathing to slow down
the flow of toxins in my body.

19:01.390 --> 19:04.101
Even if it's painful and uncomfortable,

19:04.643 --> 19:08.856
I can't think about the easy way out
because Grandpa will hit me.

19:10.566 --> 19:11.692
That's right.

19:12.192 --> 19:15.696
Tanjiro will scold me too.

19:18.991 --> 19:20.242
The sound just now.

19:20.868 --> 19:22.578
Was it thunder?

19:22.661 --> 19:23.871
How would I know?

19:24.496 --> 19:26.790
I don't smell a thunderstorm though.

19:28.083 --> 19:30.586
The pungent stench is getting stronger.
I can't tell.

19:31.295 --> 19:32.296
Inosuke.

19:34.381 --> 19:36.884
I want to go this way.

19:37.676 --> 19:40.220
Do whatever you want.

19:40.762 --> 19:42.389
Go down the mountain, Inosuke.

19:45.517 --> 19:47.311
Go down the mountain.

19:47.394 --> 19:49.730
Why? Just beat it!

19:49.813 --> 19:52.399
Well, you're seriously injured.

19:52.482 --> 19:54.985
I'm not injured!

19:59.072 --> 20:00.866
No, Inosuke.

20:00.949 --> 20:03.827
The injuries on your body
are obvious to anyone with eyes.

20:08.790 --> 20:09.833
A demon!

20:10.334 --> 20:12.920
Because of the smell
flowing throughout the entire mountain,

20:13.003 --> 20:14.588
I didn't notice her at all.

20:16.840 --> 20:18.926
I'll cut her in half!

20:19.009 --> 20:20.677
Damn you, demon!

20:21.178 --> 20:22.596
Don't run!

20:22.679 --> 20:23.680
Inosuke!

20:25.682 --> 20:26.892
Dad!

20:26.975 --> 20:28.602
Who's your dad?

20:30.687 --> 20:31.772
Inosuke!

20:43.825 --> 20:49.289
Stay away from my family!

20:52.417 --> 20:55.128
I'm leaving the rest to you, Dad.

20:59.758 --> 21:02.219
Breath of Water. Second Form.

21:02.302 --> 21:04.012
Water Wheel!

22:49.159 --> 22:52.287
-Tales of Demon Slayer Academy.
-Tales of Demon Slayer Academy.

22:52.788 --> 22:55.415
Honestly, a school prefect needs
to be early so I didn't want to do it.

22:55.499 --> 22:57.125
But it's hard to give it up

22:57.209 --> 22:59.503
 because I'm checking
their clothing and grooming.

22:59.586 --> 23:01.880
Even if I stare at the girls,
I won't be scolded.

23:01.963 --> 23:03.131
Nezuko.

23:06.802 --> 23:08.637
Today, Makomo is cute too.

23:08.720 --> 23:10.430
That senior looks beautiful too.

23:11.556 --> 23:13.183
Mr. Tomioka!

23:13.266 --> 23:16.019
I can explain. I'm only checking
their clothing and grooming.

23:16.645 --> 23:18.480
Before you pick
on the other students' clothing,

23:18.563 --> 23:19.523
take care of your own hair!

23:19.606 --> 23:20.816
My hair color is natural!

23:20.899 --> 23:23.485
Next, episode 18, "A Forged Bond."

23:25.070 --> 23:26.363
My hair is really natural.

23:26.446 --> 23:27.823
Subtitle translation by Michelle Chai
